## 2. Go Store Model

**`/bench/repo/store/memo.go`** -- line 35

```go
type Memo struct {
    ID         int32
    UID        string
    RowStatus  RowStatus
    CreatorID  int32
    CreatedTs  int64
    UpdatedTs  int64
    Content    string
    Visibility Visibility
    Pinned     bool
    Payload    *storepb.MemoPayload
    ParentUID  *string
}
```

The same file also defines companion types `FindMemo` (line 57), `FindMemoPayload` (line 84), and `UpdateMemo` (line 93). The `Visibility` type is defined at line 13 with constants `Public`, `Protected`, and `Private`. The `Payload` field references `storepb.MemoPayload`, which is the generated Go code from the store-layer protobuf (see below).

